swap any two numbers
Java Code:
class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int a=3;
        int b=9;
        System.out.println("Before swap:a="+a+"and b="+b);
        int temp=a;
        a=b;
        b=temp;
        System.out.println("After swap:a="+a+"and b="+b);
    }
}
output:
Before swap:a=3and b=9
After swap:a=9and b=3
